        "closed_at": "2022-11-28T20:28:27Z",
        "author_association": "NONE",
        "active_lock_reason": null,
        "draft": false,
        "pull_request": {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/react-native-orientation/pulls/5",
          "merged_at": "2022-11-28T20:28:27Z"
        },
        "body": "Android doesn't trigger an orientation-change event when the orientation changed while the activity is backgrounded.  Sending an orientation-change event when resuming the app ensures the latest orientation is emitted to the React context.\r\n\r\nCreated a `util` package to house some orientation-conversion logic.",
